      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littlerock%2C_Washington"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Rutledge’s homestead earned Centennial Farm status in 1989 and sits on the Thurston County Historic Register.",
